      "content": "acetaminophen is not helping much. i have a whole bottle of the 800mg ibuprofen here and i really can't deal with this back pain tonight. if i just take one of the 800mg ones, is that basically the same as the little regular ones? i just want to know if it's actually dangerous or if people just say that to be safe. i'm a pretty healthy person otherwise.",
